<section class="reading-sync" id="reading-sync" data-reading-sync aria-labelledby="sync-heading"><div class="reading-sync-heading"><div><span class="reading-eyebrow">YOUR READING, YOUR ACCOUNT</span><h2 id="sync-heading">Private reading sync</h2></div><a href="/privacy.html#browser">Privacy Policy</a></div><p>Choose to sync saved verses, your reading place, daily goal, reading history, study notes and weekly reflections with your account. Guest reading data stays separate until you import it. Account data is kept separately on this device, even when sync is paused.</p><p class="reading-sync-status" data-sync-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking reading storage…</p><p data-sync-counts hidden><span>Pending changes</span>: <bdi data-sync-pending dir="ltr">0</bdi> · <span>Conflicts to review</span>: <bdi data-sync-conflicts dir="ltr">0</bdi></p><div class="reading-sync-buttons"><a class="reading-primary" data-sync-signin href="/login.html">Sign in to use private sync</a><button type="button" data-sync-enable hidden>Enable private sync</button><button type="button" data-sync-pause hidden>Pause sync</button><button type="button" data-sync-now hidden>Sync now</button><button type="button" data-sync-import hidden>Import this browser’s guest reading data</button><button type="button" data-sync-retry hidden>Retry account check</button></div><p class="reading-small" data-sync-import-note hidden>Import adds records missing from your account and keeps existing account records. Only import notes that belong to you. Original guest data stays in this browser.</p><p class="reading-small" data-sync-feedback role="status" hidden></p><details class="reading-conflicts" data-sync-review hidden><summary>Review conflicting changes</summary><p>A record was changed on another device. Review both versions before choosing which conflicting changes to keep. Other records continue syncing.</p><div data-sync-conflict-list></div><div class="reading-sync-buttons"><button type="button" data-sync-remote>Use account versions</button><button type="button" data-sync-local>Keep this device’s versions</button></div></details><p class="reading-small">Pausing stops new uploads; existing account data remains. Unsynced edits need this browser’s data to stay intact. Sign out when using a shared device.</p></section>
